{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2020-05-26 09:30:00', 'title': 'EQT ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF ASSET SALE AND STRATEGIC VOLUME CURTAILMENT', 'text': 'EQT ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF ASSET SALE AND STRATEGIC VOLUME CURTAILMENT.EQT CORP - ON MAY 14, MADE STRATEGIC DECISION TO TEMPORARILY CURTAIL ABOUT 1.4 BCFE PER DAY OF GROSS PRODUCTION.EQT CORP - ASSUMING PRODUCTION REMAINS CURTAILED THROUGH JUNE 30, CO EXPECT Q2 SALES VOLUMES TO BE 315 - 335 BCFE.EQT CORP - BELIEVES VOLUME CURTAILMENT ACTIONS TO BE VALUE ACCRETIVE, AS DEFERRED PRODUCTION WILL BE MONETIZED A HIGHER FORWARD COMMODITY PRICE.EQT CORP - REITERATES Q2 2020 AVERAGE DIFFERENTIAL GUIDANCE.EQT CORP - CURTAILMENT COULD POTENTIALLY CONTINUE THROUGH END OF Q2 2020.EQT CORP - Q2 TOTAL PER UNIT OPERATING COSTS EXPECTED TO BE AT HIGH-END OF FY GUIDANCE RANGE OF $1.34 - $1.46 PER MCFE.EQT CORP - REITERATES PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED 2020 PRODUCTION.EQT CORP - CLOSED DEAL TO SELL CERTAIN NON-STRATEGIC ASSETS IN PENNSYLVANIA, WEST VIRGINIA TO DIVERSIFIED GAS AND OIL PLC.'}